SELECT "lesson_id", "ord", "kind", "content" FROM jsonb_populate_recordset(NULL::ling."lesson_step", '[{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The accusative marks the direct object, the person or thing a verb acts on. It also follows *pre* (for) and *na* when it means *onto* or *to*.\n\n- Feminine nouns in *-a* take *-u*: *žena → ženu*, *ulica → ulicu*, *gazdiná → gazdinú*. Feminine nouns ending in a consonant do not change: *kosť*, *miestnosť*.\n- Masculine animate nouns take *-a*: *brat → brata*. Those in *-a* take *-u*: *hrdina → hrdinu*.\n- Masculine inanimate and neuter nouns look like the nominative: *Vidím dom. Vidím mesto.*","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I see a woman.","sk":"Vidím ženu.","highlight":{"end":10,"start":6}},{"en":"I have a brother.","sk":"Mám brata.","highlight":{"end":9,"start":4}},{"en":"I am going to the square.","sk":"Idem na námestie.","highlight":{"end":16,"start":8}}]},"lesson_id":"acc-sg"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["verb-vidiet","prep-pre","prep-na-acc","q-koho-acc","q-co-acc"]},"lesson_id":"acc-sg"},{"ord":2,"kind":"comprehension","content":{"kind":"comprehension","exerciseIds":["ex-140da36a9f","ex-41e52bdfd9","ex-95b51f9ebd","ex-4f4a53a75b","ex-23c3375a79","ex-4a17f20e77","ex-5c2e81b7a4","ex-5adbce8449","ex-d6ef446a27","ex-9dd0925067","ex-c3fbd5b283","ex-0163aff340"]},"lesson_id":"acc-sg"},{"ord":3,"kind":"production","content":{"kind":"production","exerciseIds":["ex-3b2e072c21","ex-04f2286efe","ex-9308112f39","ex-5a9a0b1564","ex-60c412ebd9","ex-b8c82eb2c4","ex-3fa94c21d0","ex-4fffb3db0d","ex-d83571bdf1","ex-c9b6517502","ex-23c01ee7c9","ex-23871d6f92"]},"lesson_id":"acc-sg"},{"ord":4,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-b84236ccfd","ex-57f44308d5","ex-71a40f9b6e","ex-9fe9bda7fe","ex-15a5a8b103","ex-09709d4f16","ex-4834c11990","ex-58164cd763","ex-323958b3bd"]},"lesson_id":"acc-sg"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The locative appears only after a preposition. With *v* and *na* it says where something is, *o* means *about*, *pri* means *by* and *po* means *after*.\n\n- Hard masculine and neuter nouns take *-e*: *dom → v dome*, *mesto → v meste*. Soft ones take *-i*: *stroj → v stroji*, *srdce → v srdci*.\n- Masculine animate nouns take *-ovi*: *o bratovi*, *o hrdinovi*.\n- Feminine nouns in *-a* take *-e* after a hard consonant and *-i* after a soft one: *v Bratislave*, *na ulici*. Nouns in a consonant take *-i*: *v miestnosti*.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I live in Bratislava.","sk":"Bývam v Bratislave.","highlight":{"end":18,"start":8}},{"en":"I am in the shop.","sk":"Som v obchode.","highlight":{"end":13,"start":6}},{"en":"We are talking about my brother.","sk":"Hovoríme o bratovi.","highlight":{"end":18,"start":11}}]},"lesson_id":"loc-sg"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["prep-v-loc","prep-na-loc","prep-o-loc","prep-pri","prep-po-loc","q-kde"]},"lesson_id":"loc-sg"},{"ord":2,"kind":"comprehension","content":{"kind":"comprehension","exerciseIds":["ex-68e8bd9c74","ex-c37ce2b216","ex-a44f8812e6","ex-e489b5d319","ex-866980bf47","ex-e7b965d8f9","ex-e7cb0b0740","ex-2319f36df6","ex-8e601cd8bd","ex-9d04b3e2f1","ex-0cfe45d9b1","ex-9730dd356e"]},"lesson_id":"loc-sg"},{"ord":3,"kind":"production","content":{"kind":"production","exerciseIds":["ex-897759c048","ex-3e0c6afbb6","ex-17e659c946","ex-6e5c2d9e03","ex-d3ff11cf4d","ex-9c2b2a61ce","ex-17c41dedd5","ex-0f310ea0e4","ex-fb7de462fd","ex-f69de86124","ex-02cadee4ca","ex-fa61d5a378"]},"lesson_id":"loc-sg"},{"ord":4,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-338473d9f9","ex-2211e305f2","ex-71064a54bc","ex-ac838a8842","ex-5ec9eb74c3","ex-35c3c382da","ex-4cd5c04b9e","ex-e0cc2504a1","ex-4f4e2caeb4"]},"lesson_id":"loc-sg"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The genitive follows *do* (to), *z* (from), *od* (from a person) and *bez* (without). Feminine nouns take *-y* or *-e*: *z Bratislavy*, *bez práce*. Neuter nouns take *-a*: *do mesta*.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I am going to town.","sk":"Idem do mesta.","highlight":{"end":13,"start":8}}]},"lesson_id":"gen-sg"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["prep-do","prep-z","prep-od","prep-bez"]},"lesson_id":"gen-sg"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-7b21c0d4e9","ex-8fcdc7697a","ex-9aaafb3eff","ex-56470a64a2"]},"lesson_id":"gen-sg"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The instrumental follows *s* (with). Masculine and neuter nouns take *-om*: *s kamarátom*. Feminine nouns take *-ou*: *s prácou*.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I am going to the cinema with a friend.","sk":"Idem do kina s kamarátom.","highlight":{"end":24,"start":15}}]},"lesson_id":"ins-sg"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["prep-s-ins","q-s-kym"]},"lesson_id":"ins-sg"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-02a5298a45","ex-b11775c35b","ex-21081d7910"]},"lesson_id":"ins-sg"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The dative marks the person something is done for. *Pomáhať* (to help) takes the dative, and so does *k* (towards). Start with the pronouns *mu* (him) and *jej* (her), then nouns: *Pomáham bratovi.*","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I help my brother.","sk":"Pomáham bratovi.","highlight":{"end":15,"start":8}}]},"lesson_id":"dat-pron"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["verb-pomahat","prep-k","q-komu"]},"lesson_id":"dat-pron"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-b4e1f09a37","ex-16008b5771","ex-b95deb20d2","ex-5a10fe11fe"]},"lesson_id":"dat-pron"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"In the plural, inanimate nouns have the same form in the nominative and the accusative: *knihy*, *domy*, *dievčatá*. Animate masculine nouns take the genitive form in the accusative.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I have two books.","sk":"Mám dve knihy.","highlight":{"end":13,"start":8}}]},"lesson_id":"nom-acc-pl"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["verb-vidiet"]},"lesson_id":"nom-acc-pl"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-71cea985fd","ex-28bc300481","ex-5c2676c1ec"]},"lesson_id":"nom-acc-pl"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"The plural locative ends in *-och* or *-ách*, the instrumental in *-mi* or *-ami*, and the dative in *-om* or *-ám*: *o ľuďoch*, *s kamarátmi*, *Pomáham rodičom.*","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"We are talking about people.","sk":"Hovoríme o ľuďoch.","highlight":{"end":17,"start":11}}]},"lesson_id":"loc-ins-dat-pl"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["prep-o-loc","prep-s-ins","verb-pomahat"]},"lesson_id":"loc-ins-dat-pl"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-1e3e3bb28a","ex-2b721a22c9","ex-233e14c7d6"]},"lesson_id":"loc-ins-dat-pl"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"After *päť* and higher numbers the noun is in the genitive plural. Feminine and neuter nouns often lose their ending and lengthen a vowel: *kníh*, *miest*. Masculine nouns take *-ov*: *päť počítačov*.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I have five books.","sk":"Mám päť kníh.","highlight":{"end":12,"start":8}}]},"lesson_id":"gen-pl"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["num-pat"]},"lesson_id":"gen-pl"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-e8ebfdec49","ex-38617e73f0","ex-4aa6cdf8c8"]},"lesson_id":"gen-pl"},{"ord":0,"kind":"explain","content":{"md":"Every case together. Look at the word before the gap: the preposition or the verb chooses the case.","kind":"explain","examples":[{"en":"I bought coffee for my wife.","sk":"Kúpil som kávu pre ženu.","highlight":{"end":23,"start":19}}]},"lesson_id":"mixed"},{"ord":1,"kind":"triggers","content":{"kind":"triggers","triggerIds":["prep-z","prep-pri","prep-pre"]},"lesson_id":"mixed"},{"ord":2,"kind":"checkpoint","content":{"kind":"checkpoint","passShare":0.75,"exerciseIds":["ex-4f360c2cdb","ex-559cd71382","ex-3e3e34a68b"]},"lesson_id":"mixed"}]'::jsonb);

